{"id":"959753274","kind":"answer","title":"手机上的anki app 复习的间隔时间可以改吗 在哪里改？","author":"Thoughts Memo","original_authors":["Thoughts Memo"],"original_source_urls":[],"publisher":"Thoughts Memo","column":"间隔重复的历史","date":"2020-01-02","updated":"2020-01-02","votes":40,"comment_count":16,"minutes":1,"chars":250,"keywords":["间隔重复","记忆稳定性","可提取性","间隔效应","SuperMemo"],"summary":"请问题主用的是 ankidroid（安卓） 还是 ankimobile（ios）？ 如果是安卓，请在主界面长按「牌组/记忆库」>> 点击牌组选项 你就会看到：「选项组」、「组管理」、「新卡片」、「复习」等选项。 然后点击「复习」 修改时间间隔因子 就可以了。 具体的参数修改建议看下面这篇文章 叶峻峣：【硬核】参数模拟——每天…","question_detail_html":"","zhihu_url":"https://www.zhihu.com/question/363933894/answer/959753274","restoration":null,"toc":[],"html":"<p data-pid=\"zWoquimU\">请问题主用的是 ankidroid（安卓） 还是 ankimobile（ios）？</p><p data-pid=\"jF-Ef5fh\">如果是安卓，请在主界面长按「牌组/记忆库」&gt;&gt; 点击牌组选项</p><figure data-size=\"small\"><noscript><img class=\"origin_image zh-lightbox-thumb\" data-default-watermark-src=\"https://picx.zhimg.com/50/v2-9c3ee55c33d9e937227b643665dbadff_720w.jpg?source=2c26e567\" data-original-token=\"v2-ff122a87d13b5ab9f795f22dbda8828d\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://picx.zhimg.com/v2-dfd6949fa2e02d012603db15ffa6f23a_r.jpg?source=2c26e567\" width=\"1080\"/></noscript><img class=\"origin_image zh-lightbox-thumb lazy\" data-default-watermark-src=\"https://picx.zhimg.com/50/v2-9c3ee55c33d9e937227b643665dbadff_720w.jpg?source=2c26e567\" data-original-token=\"v2-ff122a87d13b5ab9f795f22dbda8828d\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://picx.zhimg.com/50/v2-dfd6949fa2e02d012603db15ffa6f23a_720w.jpg?source=2c26e567\" width=\"1080\"/></figure><p data-pid=\"NPEigPYs\">你就会看到：「选项组」、「组管理」、「新卡片」、「复习」等选项。</p><figure data-size=\"small\"><noscript><img class=\"origin_image zh-lightbox-thumb\" data-default-watermark-src=\"https://pic1.zhimg.com/50/v2-7869a03f4c96bd2d2af3bc9aab4975c2_720w.jpg?source=2c26e567\" data-original-token=\"v2-8de248d0d4bdde4aa3452dfbddfda78a\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://pic1.zhimg.com/v2-95afbe7d7e897d3b19056fb5b79e607a_r.jpg?source=2c26e567\" width=\"1080\"/></noscript><img class=\"origin_image zh-lightbox-thumb lazy\" data-default-watermark-src=\"https://pic1.zhimg.com/50/v2-7869a03f4c96bd2d2af3bc9aab4975c2_720w.jpg?source=2c26e567\" data-original-token=\"v2-8de248d0d4bdde4aa3452dfbddfda78a\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://pica.zhimg.com/50/v2-95afbe7d7e897d3b19056fb5b79e607a_720w.jpg?source=2c26e567\" width=\"1080\"/></figure><p data-pid=\"B03y1cmn\">然后点击「复习」</p><figure data-size=\"small\"><noscript><img class=\"origin_image zh-lightbox-thumb\" data-default-watermark-src=\"https://pica.zhimg.com/50/v2-0ad729a74d4227730e2408621ec500a2_720w.jpg?source=2c26e567\" data-original-token=\"v2-c7b6f3c99ec53a99d05fc13c3e32880a\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://picx.zhimg.com/v2-517ec9c6a68c83c2adaff1736a8c1b6c_r.jpg?source=2c26e567\" width=\"1080\"/></noscript><img class=\"origin_image zh-lightbox-thumb lazy\" data-default-watermark-src=\"https://pica.zhimg.com/50/v2-0ad729a74d4227730e2408621ec500a2_720w.jpg?source=2c26e567\" data-original-token=\"v2-c7b6f3c99ec53a99d05fc13c3e32880a\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://pica.zhimg.com/50/v2-517ec9c6a68c83c2adaff1736a8c1b6c_720w.jpg?source=2c26e567\" width=\"1080\"/></figure><p data-pid=\"LlWfJElN\">修改时间间隔因子</p><figure data-size=\"small\"><noscript><img class=\"origin_image zh-lightbox-thumb\" data-default-watermark-src=\"https://picx.zhimg.com/50/v2-06e1a45c90e1f2ef59ae6433149f92ec_720w.jpg?source=2c26e567\" data-original-token=\"v2-4824048f0634f24e563084e0c7a602cf\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://pic1.zhimg.com/v2-67a464ede3d5baaf3f9c04a74f151628_r.jpg?source=2c26e567\" width=\"1080\"/></noscript><img class=\"origin_image zh-lightbox-thumb lazy\" data-default-watermark-src=\"https://picx.zhimg.com/50/v2-06e1a45c90e1f2ef59ae6433149f92ec_720w.jpg?source=2c26e567\" data-original-token=\"v2-4824048f0634f24e563084e0c7a602cf\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://picx.zhimg.com/50/v2-67a464ede3d5baaf3f9c04a74f151628_720w.jpg?source=2c26e567\" width=\"1080\"/></figure><p data-pid=\"ktAPT0vi\">就可以了。</p><p data-pid=\"TlikuWIb\">具体的参数修改建议看下面这篇文章</p><a class=\"internal\" data-image=\"https://pic2.zhimg.com/v2-8fd199975dad37526725da7ddfc4f381_r.jpg\" data-image-height=\"733\" data-image-width=\"1822\" href=\"https://zhuanlan.zhihu.com/p/78398403\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">叶峻峣：【硬核】参数模拟——每天 40 张新卡片，365 天后我要复习多少？</a><p data-pid=\"mAc5EQyF\">算法介绍看这个</p><a class=\"internal\" data-image=\"https://pic2.zhimg.com/v2-75cbe90ad0adb828b95624e2460d273f_r.jpg\" data-image-height=\"671\" data-image-width=\"1339\" href=\"https://zhuanlan.zhihu.com/p/42921090\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">叶峻峣：Anki 算法与术语浅谈</a><p data-pid=\"T9EAySQZ\">记忆原理看这个</p><a class=\"internal tm-internal\" data-image=\"https://pic3.zhimg.com/v2-810e0b24320f5cb2b6a3b357c474e014_r.jpg\" data-image-height=\"753\" data-image-width=\"1402\" data-tm-id=\"99505568\" href=\"#/post/99505568\">叶峻峣：05 1988：记忆的两个组成成分</a><p data-pid=\"9-dE4ZFX\">希望对题主有所帮助</p>","rec_chain":[{"id":"99505568","title":"05 1988：记忆的两个组成成分","author":"Piotr Wozniak","votes":49,"minutes":20,"reason":"本回答Level 1 核心引用"}],"rec_bridge":[{"id":"179076885","title":"记忆的两个组成成分|浓缩通俗版","author":"Piotr Wozniak","votes":75,"minutes":3,"reason":"延伸深读 · Piotr Wozniak"},{"id":"279166945","title":"间隔效应","author":"Andy Matuschak","votes":21,"minutes":3,"reason":"延伸深读 · Andy Matuschak"},{"id":"579476637","title":"记忆的双组分模型","author":"Piotr Wozniak","votes":8,"minutes":3,"reason":"延伸深读 · Piotr Wozniak"},{"id":"456205621","title":"11 1997：启用神经网络","author":"Piotr Wozniak","votes":17,"minutes":38,"reason":"延伸深读 · Piotr Wozn